  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n17(1)/(2)% of 3(1)/(4)% of 33(1)/(3)% of 7200\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nx% of y = (x)/(100) times y\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n7200 times (1)/(3) times (13)/(400) times (35)/(200) = ?\n\n⇒ ? = 2400 times (13)/(400) times (35)/(200)\n\n⇒ ? = 6 times 13 times (35)/(200)\n\n⇒ ? = 78 times (35)/(200)\n\n⇒ ? = (2730)/(200)\n\n⇒ ? = 13.65\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (3).**",
